ion\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral} \\vdash \\bar{\\cdot}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\bar n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span> : 自然数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>的形式化 numeral</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> : 后继符号 (successor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> : 零符号</li>\n<li>numeral 将自然数编码为系统G中的项</li>\n<li>这是算术化的基础：自然数 → 形式项</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-numeral-—-Numeral-$\\bar{n}$","text":"df-numeral — Numeral $\\bar{n}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\cdot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral} \\vdash \\bar{\\cdot}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\bar n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":788,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excer